# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare `build` also matches any
# directory named build at any depth.
#
# This now also covers assess.sh's output, which is a real account's inventory --
# resource names, role names, environment variable NAMES, API ids. No secret
# VALUES are ever captured, but on a public repo that is still somebody's
# infrastructure described in full.
/build/
*.zip
